me\\(String userName\\)":[264,295],"#ProactiveTriggerAPI- Scoped#ProactiveTriggerAPI - setUserName\\(String userName\\)#{1}":[266,295],"#ProactiveTriggerAPI- Scoped#ProactiveTriggerAPI - setUserSessionId\\(String userId\\)":[296,347],"#ProactiveTriggerAPI- Scoped#ProactiveTriggerAPI - setUserSessionId\\(String userId\\)#{1}":[298,347]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Proactive Triggers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/conversational-interfaces/proactive-triggers-landing-page.md","line":26},{"title":"Configuring Proactive Triggers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/conversational-interfaces/configuring-proactive-triggers.md","line":28},{"title":"ProactiveTriggerAPI - createTrigger\\(String triggerTypeId\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ProactiveTriggerScopedAPI.md","line":38},{"title":"How Proactive Triggers work","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/conversational-interfaces/how-proactive-triggers-work.md","line":38},{"title":"ProactiveTriggerAPI - setUserId\\(String userId\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ProactiveTriggerScopedAPI.md","line":42},{"title":"ProactiveTriggerAPI - setUserName\\(String userName\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ProactiveTriggerScopedAPI.md","line":43},{"title":"ProactiveTriggerAPI - setUserSessionId\\(String userId\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ProactiveTriggerScopedAPI.md","line":44},{"title":"ProactiveTriggerAPI - setTriggerRecord\\(String triggerRecord\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ProactiveTriggerScopedAPI.md","line":46},{"title":"ProactiveTriggerAPI - process\\(\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ProactiveTriggerScopedAPI.md","line":48},{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":58}],"metadata":{"title":"ProactiveTriggerAPI - Scoped","description":"The ProactiveTriggerAPI enables you to create server-side triggers that send context-specific messages to a specified user.Creates a server-side Proactive Triggers event.Executes the specified Proactive Triggers API request.Sets the trigger record on which to apply the Proactive Triggers' rules and actions.Sets the user to whom to send the message generated by the associated Proactive Triggers event using the user ID.Sets the user to whom to send the message generated by the associated Proactive Triggers event using the user name.Sets the user session ID on the associated Proactive Triggers event. When using this method, the Proactive message is only sent to the specific user associated with a specific session.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/ProactiveTriggerScopedAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":6,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[52,56],[97,111],[142,156],[197,211],[248,262],[278,294],[331,345]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/ProactiveTriggerScopedAPI.md"},
